      <Parameter>
         <Name>FITS Extension #1 Brightness</Name>
         <Description>Unpolarized K-corona brightness in the PUNCH Level 3 CTM composite mosaic, provided in output coordinates. The data are stored in FITS extension 1 as a 4096 x 4096 image; the FITS EXTNAME is &quot;PRIMARY DATA ARRAY&quot;.</Description>
         <Units>2.009e+07 W m^-2 sr^-1</Units>
         <Wave>
            <WaveType>Electromagnetic</WaveType>
            <WaveQuantity>Intensity</WaveQuantity>
            <WavelengthRange>
               <Low>450</Low>
               <High>750</High>
               <Units>nm</Units>
            </WavelengthRange>
         </Wave>
      </Parameter>
      <Parameter>
         <Name>FITS Extension #2 Inverse Fractional Uncertainty</Name>
         <Description>Inverse fractional uncertainty associated with the unpolarized K-corona brightness in the PUNCH Level 3 CTM composite mosaic. The stored value is the brightness divided by its uncertainty. The data are stored in FITS extension 2 as a 4096 x 4096 image; the FITS EXTNAME is &quot;UNCERTAINTY ARRAY&quot;.</Description>
         <Units>Dimensionless</Units>
         <Support>
            <Qualifier>Uncertainty</Qualifier>
            <SupportQuantity>Other</SupportQuantity>
         </Support>
      </Parameter>
